{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act15side_level_act15side_07_beg",
  "groupId": "act15side",
  "stageId": "act15side_07",
  "title": "乱局",
  "storyCode": "IW-7",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act15side/level_act15side_07_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "527dfb4f60d649237f22f13bd129df5948168ee69df340212b4133317e973f12",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "07上"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......唔。\n头疼头疼......何事如此喧哗......嗯？\n啊......原来是落子声响，叮叮当当。\n棋罢不知人换世，梦醒只道是何年......何年......何年......\n呃......\n......怎么酒又没了。\n这都是何苦呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "尚冢摸了摸脖子上的膏药，这是他的习惯。\n十年如一日地挑起扁担，上山下山，这也是他的习惯。\n取江峰确实很高，很险。高到没有人烟，险到万籁俱寂。\n数不清这是在尚蜀看见的第几个春天，他抬头远眺，只见人踪尽灭的山道那头，有一个人。\n一个他等了很久的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......我们终于还是再见了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "方才见过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "那时你没有带刀，就不算见过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "那现在我带刀来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......话先说明了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "我知道错不在你。我也知道，那个雨夜，死的不止是我的儿子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "你当然知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "你收养了他的女儿，她现在怎么样了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "......我打算让她接我的班。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "是打算接镖局的班，还是像你这些年做的，安安分分当个老板娘？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "都行，看她喜欢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "找着心上人没？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "没呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "可惜了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "你活不到看她出嫁的那天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "......也许今天我们不用打打杀杀的呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "不可能，我知道你的为人，你心里有愧，但我心里有怨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "怨了十年。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "......所以呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "所以你一开始就没打算今天赢我。酒楼茶馆客栈，哪一个不都是为了给你的女儿留条退路？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "你知道镖局是个得罪人的行当。你也知道，如果你不在了，镖局会是什么样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "别忘了，你挂刀而去，不守规矩，于情，大家体谅你，可于理，你还是个叛徒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "那夜之后，你若是背负着那些罪过，带领镖局继续前行，我又怎么会叛出镖局！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "我儿走镖，也是有所觉悟的，我何尝不知？可你的行为，开客栈开餐厅，难道不是践踏他们的死吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "是你！一蹶不振，逃避过去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "是啊......我是知道的，但咱们话说得有点多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "行裕镖局总镖头，问霜客，郑清钺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......尚家棍，尚冢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "早春，垂暮，树影婆娑，落雪如银。\n一阵风起，一把刀落。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "......唔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "你实在是歇息得太久了，郑清钺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "......未必是我歇息得久了，也许是你爬山爬得太多，步法又精进了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "谁知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "可你这样的英雄好汉，下半辈子却注定无法行走，也实在可惜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......只是刀势太快，雪光晃眼，被你稍微擦破裤腿，我就无法行走了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "下一刀，你挡不住。你拿的，毕竟不是家传的宝棍。只是根破木棍罢了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "——爹！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "夜儿！？你怎么......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......你果然是杜遥夜。转眼间，已经长这么大了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "唔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "二位好闲情，天色渐晚，还有空在这......比武练习。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "是你。你在这里做什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "不瞒尚师傅你说，你腰间那只盏，是我一朋友托我寻来的。我要找亭子，也和那只酒盏分不开呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "我怕刀剑无眼，二位切磋之间......误碰了酒盏，得不偿失。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "爹，你这是在做什么——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "......夜儿，我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "十年前，行裕镖局接了一单大镖。但是路上遭遇暴雨，在荒野上被土匪袭击。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "为了保货，郑清钺放弃了同行的镖师，十几个弟兄死于非命，其中有我的儿子，也有你的......亲生父亲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "郑清钺见死不救。他不仅见死不救，到头来，他也没把货物保住，没把镖局名声保住。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "我——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "甚至再后来，他对镖局之落魄视而不见，逃避失败，你知道吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "在那之后，你的母亲也离开了尚蜀，回了老家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "杜遥夜......这些，你当真知道吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "夜儿。这没你的事，爹这就——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "你就是......尚师傅吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "不。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "是叛徒尚冢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "你以为本小姐是什么人？一无所知地像个傻子一样在温室里长大到今天？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "啊，我亲爹亲娘的事情，我都知道。郑老头这些年做了什么，怎么做的，我比你更清楚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "所以，今天我便是要告诉你们——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "——镖局也好酒馆也罢，迟早是要姓杜的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "麻烦二老，不要现在给我找麻烦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......你要是不让开，是要吃苦头的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "有话好好说......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......铜钱剑？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "笑话。难道你要在我面前卖弄什么术法不成？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "欸，免了免了，我可不是擅长近身战斗的人......只是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "这玩意，你要便拿去，接着。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "——休想！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "郑清钺！你还敢分神！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "——别对爹出手！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "唔，碍事！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "呃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "夜儿！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "尚冢，你这老糊涂，竟然对晚辈动手！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "叮的一声。\n扁担一撇，压下刀光，可郑清钺的刀，却不可避地偏向了别处。\n而那酒盏又实在是坚硬，若非如此，天底下有什么瓷器，是挨了郑清钺一刀还能完好无损的？\n可是这一刀，却把那只漆黑如夜的酒盏，打飞了出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "——酒盏！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "别管我们！忙你的去吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "可你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "这是家务事！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "......好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "坚持一小会，马上就有人来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "夜儿，不能让他去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "这老匹夫想要你命啊，你还要管那破玩意！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "杜遥夜说得对。十年前，你也是从山崖上弄丢了这只酒盏。如今，再来一次，滋味如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "尚冢......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "要我让开，办法简单。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "啧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "到此为止！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "郑前辈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "——酒盏被击落山崖，那个龙门人已经去找了，二位，动作快！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "感谢前辈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "太合。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "——嘁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......杜小姐这是做什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "你不能去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......为何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "......梁大人和姓鲤的，还有两位看着就不近人情的朝廷特使。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "总要选边站的，我想通了而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "再说，我答应过姓鲤的了， 江湖人一诺千金，也是规矩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "夜儿！别胡闹！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......人真多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "今天本不该来这么多人。但是，无妨......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "做个了断，有你我就够了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "——啧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "杜小姐，你应该知道我们是秉公办事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "我看未必有那么“秉公”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "请让开。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "不。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "那就失礼了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "且慢且慢，这么一个大老爷们，就这么对一个姑娘家出手，不好吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "——廉家阴晴扇，果然好功夫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "不识抬举。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "公子，没事吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......没事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "呃，疼疼疼，竟然能把这么大块石砖随手抛出......真是可怕......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "敬酒不吃吃罚酒，无话可说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "弩箭！是谁？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "我在这里哟。看错方向啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "你是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "不要碍事，兔子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "罗德岛是不打算协助司岁台了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "不打算。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "你们也许有你们的道理。但是年和我们相处了很久，我清楚她的为人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "兽心难测，为人又算的了什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "也许算不了什么，但起码要算个我吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "还有我。夕小姐点破迷障，也算给了我一记当头棒喝......我这人稍微有点喜欢躲事，不过好就好在，我还是知恩图报的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "......廉家阴晴扇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "上次被你吓着了，不敢动手，这次倒是有机会领教领教。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "......嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "你们要抢你们的盏，就滚一边儿去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "这只酒盏对镖局意义重大，要是就这么搁置一旁，我和死了有什么区别？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "你现在本就和死了没什么区别。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "好好好，现在你的眼神才像郑清钺的眼神，是因为女儿在这儿，还是因为镖局颜面？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "你总算是一个想活下去的人了，这样我们的胜负才有意义。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "......尚冢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "若是你的儿子在天之灵，知道你今天如此作为，他会高兴吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "别拿那套话来诓我，他就是活着，站在这儿，他也拦不住他老子！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......慎师傅，为何在此？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "把那几人送到山顶，我就下山了。想着迟早会遇到梁大人的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "梁大人不也果真来了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "过了许久了，我来近处看看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "那宁小姐那边？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "察觉到了，或许一早就察觉到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "书房失窃，多半是她的小心思吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "......还请梁大人劝劝宁小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "其他几位先不提，那位姓白的老陶工，绝对不能出手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "白天师......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "他攥一把天雷洒向人间，就等同司岁台和礼部撕破了脸皮，天师府的一双脚，也不知道站哪儿好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "有劳慎师傅操心了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "唉......我就是个船夫，操什么心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "以前戍守过几年北疆，天寒地冻没事儿干，就和袍泽弟兄扯些家国大事，聊着玩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "既然大家都是一心向炎，不过些许小事上差之毫厘，大没有必要失之千里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "此乃匹夫之责。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "我是匹夫，梁大人也算匹夫？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "大地厚广，万物自由。普天之下，皆为匹夫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "唉......梁大人希望我怎么做？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "希望慎师傅保尚蜀太平。如果最后出了什么岔子......希望慎师傅抢在宁小姐和那五人有所行动之前，先一步息事宁人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "有句老话叫作尽人事以待天命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "可惜了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "梁某人从大炎朝堂之上学来的第一句话，便是“天命在人”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
